t's holding a complex truth without letting it tip into a slander. I'm not blocking you from saying the same thing in plainer terms. I'm asking you to say the true thing, not the exaggerated version of it. The academic research doesn't need to be translated into a cruder form to be acknowledged. The precise form is the honest form.
